# The app uses TWO env files, one per folder. Their templates are:
#   backend/.env.example   -> copy to backend/.env
#   frontend/.env.example  -> copy to frontend/.env
# See docs/SETUP.md for what each value is and where to find it.
# Never commit real .env files, and never put SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY or GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY in the frontend.
